        "For fabric Nilkamal sofas, upholstery repair options range from patching worn or torn sections to full re-upholstery in new fabric. We carry a range of upholstery fabrics including cotton blends, microfibre, velvet, and chenille in standard and custom colours. Full sofa re-upholstery for a standard Nilkamal three-seater starts from Rs.9,000 and transforms the sofa's appearance entirely. For <a href=\"/sofa-foam-replacement-delhi\">sofa foam replacement in Delhi</a>, pricing starts at Rs.999 per seat using high-density polyurethane foam. We also carry memory foam topper options for an upgraded seating experience.",
        "We service Nilkamal sofas across all Delhi areas including South Delhi, Greater Kailash, Hauz Khas, Vasant Vihar, Green Park, South Extension, Dwarka, Rohini, Punjabi Bagh, Paschim Vihar, and Anand Vihar. Our technicians carry all required materials in their service vehicles so that foam replacements and patch repairs can be completed on the first visit. For more complex upholstery work, we provide a timeline estimate at the inspection. Also see our <a href=\"/sofa-spring-repair-delhi\">sofa spring repair service in Delhi</a> for spring-related issues.",
