        "An often-overlooked benefit of foam replacement is that it can simultaneously address other issues. When we open cushion covers to replace foam, we also inspect the internal frame, springs, and webbing. If we identify additional issues such as broken springs or damaged webbing, we can address them in the same visit, avoiding the need for a separate service call later.",
